          "type": "why_choose",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Choose Iced SPORTea?",
            "content": "<p>When it comes to <strong>cold brew tea</strong>, not all options are created equal. Here’s why SPORTea® stands out:</p><p>✔️<strong>Naturally Energizing</strong>– Unlike traditional <strong>iced tea </strong>that relies on sugar or caffeine spikes, SPORTea®provides long-lasting, steady energy.<br/>✔️<strong>Hydration + Electrolytes</strong>– Replenish your body with a perfectly balanced tea that hydrates without artificial additives.<br/>✔️<strong>Zero Calories, No Sugar</strong>– Enjoy a delicious, flavorful tea without the guilt of added sugars or artificial sweeteners.<br/>✔️<strong>Cold Brew Convenience</strong>– No need for boiling water! Just drop a bag in cold water and let it steep in your fridge.<br/>✔️<strong>Smooth & Refreshing Taste</strong>– No bitterness, no dry aftertaste—just crisp, clean refreshment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cold_brew_44dWNg": {
          "type": "cold_brew",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cold Brew Iced Tea: The Best Way to Enjoy Iced SPORTea®",
            "content": "<h3><strong>What is Cold Brew Tea?</strong></h3><p>Cold brew tea is a <strong>gentler, smoother way</strong> of brewing tea without the use of boiling water. Unlike hot-brewed <strong>iced tea</strong>, cold brew tea:</p><ul><li>Extracts fewer tannins, making it <strong>less bitter</strong></li><li>Retains more natural antioxidants and nutrients</li><li>Delivers a <strong>smoother, more refreshing</strong> taste</li></ul><h3><strong>How to Cold Brew Iced SPORTea®</strong></h3><p>SPORTea® was <strong>one of the first cold brew teas</strong> on the market—even before major brands jumped on the trend! We make it incredibly easy to <strong>cold brew iced tea</strong> right in your fridge.</p><h4><strong>Arctic Brewing Method™ – How It Works</strong></h4><p>1️⃣ <strong>Drop</strong> one tea bag into <strong>one quart of cold water</strong>.<br/>2️⃣ <strong>Refrigerate for 4 hours</strong> (or overnight for stronger flavor).<br/>3️⃣ <strong>Enjoy!</strong> Serve over ice for a crisp, naturally energizing drink.</p><p>This simple <strong>cold brew method</strong> ensures maximum flavor, smoothness, and nutritional retention.</p>"
          }
        },
        "health_benefits_Eax3wi": {
          "type": "health_benefits",
          "settings": {
